Controls: CIS 4.1; NIST CM-6, CM-7; ISO 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The server-status or server-info handler is world-readable in the
block named: it shows clients, requests, server slots and the whole
configuration to anyone who asks. Only an explicitly open block is
flagged; a handler restricted to localhost, or left to the default
deny, is not. Restrict the block to localhost.
